<title>USA: Titan Holdings sets 5 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Titan Holdings sets 5 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Titan Holdings Inc said on Thursday that its board declared a five percent stock dividend payable May 12, 1997 to the company's shareholders of record as of March 21, 1997.</p>
<p>Titan Holdings had approximately 9.8 million shares outstanding as of the end of the company's first quarter.</p>
